## Challenge

The employees _____ a bonus after completing the project.

A. gave
B. were given
C. giving
D. have give

Answer: B

→ employees가 보너스를 받음
→ 수동태

---

## Key Point

### 능동

주어가 행동을 함

The manager approved the proposal.

### 수동

주어가 행동을 받음

The proposal was approved.

